Search runtime flow (what happens at runtime)
•	User calls MCP SearchBankingKnowledge(question)
•	BankingService.SearchBankingKnowledgeAsync delegates to IKnowledgeSearchService.SearchAsync(question)
•	AzureAiSearchKnowledgeService.SearchAsync:
1.	Calls OpenAI embeddings REST to get query embedding
2.	Calls Azure Cognitive Search vector search REST endpoint with vector + select fields
3.	Parses returned JSON and maps to KnowledgeSearchResultDto (with metadata)
4.	Returns top-K results to application
•	BankingService currently concatenates results into a safe string with citations for backward compatibility; full structured grounding can be passed to LLM using DTOs.
Errors and failure handling
•	Missing config => descriptive InvalidOperationException (fail cleanly)
•	Embedding/search REST failures => InvalidOperationException with response body (no secrets in message)
•	No relevant results => SearchAsync returns empty IEnumerable (application must handle and avoid hallucination)
